# Accepted findings, each with a reason. Reviewed like code.

# Node security group allows all egress (terraform-aws-modules/eks default).
# Nodes must pull images (GHCR/ECR) and llm-gateway must call LLM provider APIs,
# none of which have stable IP ranges. Egress is instead restricted per pod by
# Kubernetes NetworkPolicy (default-deny + explicit 443/5432 rules, metadata IP
# blocked), which is where the workload identity actually lives.
AVD-AWS-0104
